{"id": "EUVD-2026-80459", "enisaUuid": "2cfba384-3070-3223-8b0f-cb7f618ec6ae", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nscsi: qla2xxx: Zero dport diagnostics buffer to avoid info leak\n\nqla2x00_do_dport_diagnostics() allocates the qla_dport_diag response\nbuffer with kmalloc_obj() (non-zeroing) and, on success, copies the full\nsizeof(*dd) back to user space via sg_copy_from_buffer(). The inbound\nsg_copy_to_buffer() only fills as many bytes as the user request payload\nprovides, and qla26xx_dport_diagnostics() zeroes only dd->buf. The\noptions and unused[] fields are therefore copied out uninitialized,\nleaking kernel heap contents to user space.\n\nAllocate with kzalloc_obj(), matching qla2x00_do_dport_diagnostics_v2().", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:31:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:49:04", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2ecc30066c2284d2ed11bbd576ec97156b384054", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5dfc77099c7d9fde9520a229794b0154d7ccccc1", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d6e2411516bb95e52cb74c9c56b60ad2548a2730", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9fc03be982763a131913f84fe73b240ae45bca37", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a152edab3854f01dd2daf3eaf8f32cbabdb3834e"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89859", "GHSA-77jx-g549-23wh"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0b1eb98a-c96a-39f3-9885-18d8aa6dece1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ec89146215d124c429bff84b498dccdc4919ffa7 <9fc03be982763a131913f84fe73b240ae45bca37"}, {"id": "184c83b6-5570-39fe-8bc6-c36e7b77fa25", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "1d0b8f49-f9ed-32a1-ac9a-e2501fbf6c9d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ec89146215d124c429bff84b498dccdc4919ffa7 <5dfc77099c7d9fde9520a229794b0154d7ccccc1"}, {"id": "534bc31a-8f6a-3501-be21-d6eed48ebf0d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.112"}, {"id": "607befbf-455b-31d5-bb09-e851cb46fd8c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ec89146215d124c429bff84b498dccdc4919ffa7 <2ecc30066c2284d2ed11bbd576ec97156b384054"}, {"id": "9aeba5b2-b9e8-342f-b092-caf697353170", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "9fd41664-1e98-3b6f-b0db-655dd91f8b37", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "c5c05f10-31ee-37ae-8a49-8cca229c3b85", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "4.8"}, {"id": "c8278a96-e922-3b1b-96bf-98520dcc7e41", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ec89146215d124c429bff84b498dccdc4919ffa7 <a152edab3854f01dd2daf3eaf8f32cbabdb3834e"}, {"id": "d3bd5274-04d9-3197-840a-f40892ee8741", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ec89146215d124c429bff84b498dccdc4919ffa7 <d6e2411516bb95e52cb74c9c56b60ad2548a2730"}, {"id": "d4803eea-9004-3de1-b680-9e11550aec51", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.53"}, {"id": "e4419c59-2ee8-36a0-bce4-87e817051c44", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "56e8a42d-0003-3dc3-b26f-d86e72deda6c", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}